sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant AG as Agent API
    participant CTX as Session Context
    participant RAG as RAG Hook
    participant KN as Knowledge Pipeline
    participant BR as Brain Router
    participant T as Tool Registry

    C->>GW: POST /v1/agents/chat
    GW->>Auth: Validate Bearer token
    Auth-->>GW: Authorized
    GW->>AG: Handle agent chat

    AG->>CTX: Load session history
    CTX-->>AG: Previous messages
    AG->>AG: Append new messages

    AG->>RAG: Augment prompt
    RAG->>KN: Query relevant context
    KN-->>RAG: Knowledge chunks
    RAG-->>AG: Augmented prompt

    loop ReAct Loop (max 10 turns)
        AG->>BR: Send to LLM for reasoning
        BR-->>AG: LLM response

        alt Response contains tool calls
            AG->>T: Execute tool(s)
            T-->>AG: Tool observations
            AG->>AG: Append observation to context
        else Final answer
            AG->>AG: Break loop
        end
    end

    AG->>CTX: Save updated session
    AG-->>GW: Final response
    GW-->>C: JSON or SSE stream
